# =====================================================================
# KDM CONTENT POLICY — never commit gameplay artifacts (see README).
# Card IMAGES/ART and player-scanned AI / Hit-Location deck data are
# host-provided, session-local, and MUST NOT be source-controlled.
# Shippable "Scribe-scope" mechanical packs live in content/packs/.
# =====================================================================
content/assets/
!content/assets/.gitkeep
content/scans/
*.kdmscan
# card image formats anywhere under content/
content/**/*.png
content/**/*.jpg
content/**/*.jpeg
content/**/*.webp
content/**/*.heic
content/**/*.tiff
